{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "8f28b2a1-e408-4e89-a2bf-a720dc274941",
		"name": "Absensi Digital - Golang REST API & ESP32 (SQLite + Backdate Sync)",
		"description": "Koleksi Postman REST API Resmi untuk Sistem Presensi Digital IoT ESP32.\n\n🌟 Fitur Utama API:\n1. Autentikasi JWT Bearer.\n2. Tap Absensi Realtime dari ESP32 dengan deteksi Masuk/Keluar otomatis.\n3. Respon khusus 'already_attended' jika kartu sudah pernah absen pada hari tersebut.\n4. Sinkronisasi Data Offline / Backdate jika koneksi internet ESP32 sempat terputus.\n5. CRUD Lengkap Data Master Anggota & Presensi Manual.\n6. Reset & Import Data Dummy.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Autentikasi",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login Administrator",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200 && jsonData.token) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jwt_token\", jsonData.token);",
									"    console.log(\"JWT Token berhasil disimpan ke variabel: \", jsonData.token);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"admin\",\n    \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"login"
							]
						},
						"description": "Endpoint login untuk administrator. Token JWT akan otomatis tersimpan ke variabel {{jwt_token}} dan digunakan oleh request lain di koleksi ini."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Integrasi Mesin ESP32 & Sync Offline",
			"description": "Endpoint yang digunakan oleh mesin ESP32 (RFID / Fingerprint). Endpoint ini bersifat publik (tanpa JWT) agar mikrokontroler dapat mengirim data dengan cepat.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Tap Absen Masuk (Realtime)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"device_id\": \"ESP32-GATE-01\",\n    \"rfid_uid\": \"A1B2C301\",\n    \"tipe_scan\": \"auto\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/tap",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"attendance",
								"tap"
							]
						},
						"description": "Simulasi tap kartu pertama pada hari ini. Backend akan otomatis mencatat sebagai ABSEN MASUK dan menentukan status tepat/telat."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. Tap Absen Keluar / Pulang (Realtime)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"device_id\": \"ESP32-GATE-01\",\n    \"rfid_uid\": \"A1B2C301\",\n    \"tipe_scan\": \"keluar\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/tap",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"attendance",
								"tap"
							]
						},
						"description": "Simulasi tap kedua saat pulang. Backend akan mencatat WAKTU KELUAR dan menentukan status tepat/cepat."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Tap Saat Sudah Absen Lengkap (Respon Sudah Absen)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"device_id\": \"ESP32-GATE-01\",\n    \"rfid_uid\": \"A1B2C301\",\n    \"tipe_scan\": \"auto\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/tap",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"attendance",
								"tap"
							]
						},
						"description": "Menguji respon ketika pengguna sudah melakukan absen masuk dan keluar. Respon akan mengembalikan status: 'already_attended' dan already_recorded: true agar ESP32 bisa menampilkan pesan 'SUDAH ABSEN' di layar."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "4. Sync Offline / Backdate (Format Timestamp ISO8601)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"device_id\": \"ESP32-GATE-01\",\n    \"rfid_uid\": \"A1B2C306\",\n    \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-01T06:45:00+07:00\",\n    \"tipe_scan\": \"auto\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/tap",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"attendance",
								"tap"
							]
						},
						"description": "Digunakan saat ESP32 sempat offline / mati internet dan menyimpan data tap lokal di SD Card/Flash. Saat internet kembali online, ESP32 mengirim timestamp asli kejadian untuk dicatat secara backdate."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "5. Sync Offline / Backdate (Format Tanggal & Waktu Terpisah)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"device_id\": \"ESP32-GATE-02\",\n    \"rfid_uid\": \"A1B2C307\",\n    \"tanggal\": \"2026-08-30\",\n    \"waktu\": \"06:35:10\",\n    \"tipe_scan\": \"auto\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/tap",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"attendance",
								"tap"
							]
						},
						"description": "Format alternatif pengiriman backdate dengan memisahkan kolom 'tanggal' (YYYY-MM-DD) dan 'waktu' (HH:MM:SS)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "3. Data Master Anggota (CRUD)",
